+If an existing installation returns 401 or 403 during reconciliation, including after its account is
+deleted, `connect` removes the revoked local authorization and automatic state through the same
+cleanup path as `disconnect`, warns about incomplete auxiliary cleanup, preserves the installation
+identity and local source registry, and starts fresh pairing. Other reconciliation or network errors
+retain the previous connection and do not start replacement pairing.
 
